# Environment variables consumed by Stromy Deliverables.
#
# This plugin requires NO secrets / .env values. Its MCPs are all consumed as
# authenticated workspace connectors (OAuth), never plugin-declared:
#   - nl-gov-data, stromy-format : hosted HTTP, per-user OAuth
#   - Apify (research-apify skill): hosted https://mcp.apify.com, OAuth — the
#     client signs into their own Apify account in the connector (BYOK by
#     identity). There is no APIFY token to set here; spend lands on the client's
#     Apify account. See infra-docs/ai/byok-apify-research.md.
#
# Every ${VAR} referenced in .agents/mcp.json must still appear here (Inv #4);
# there are currently none.
